{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mighty Peckers is the explosive party platformer that turns friendly gatherings into feather-flying chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge up to 7 friends in fast-paced egg combat where timing your kicks perfectly can turn the tide of battle. Choose from multiple hilarious game modes, customize your champion chicken, and master an arsenal of explosive eggs with unique abilities. Whether you're defending your perch in Chicken a la King or desperately passing the bomb in Pass the Egg, every match delivers non-stop laughter and intense competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for game nights, parties, and anyone who's ever wanted to settle the pecking order once and for all.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518040/extras/f0a9bd01173fa57d15450d81ae45e45d.poster.avif?t=1761075751\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518040/extras/f0a9bd01173fa57d15450d81ae45e45d.webm?t=1761075751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518040/extras/f0a9bd01173fa57d15450d81ae45e45d.mp4?t=1761075751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518040?t=1761075751","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518040/1e6a6f3458d3e5ad21aa974a5df4ac7b6125edac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761075751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518040/52a864110681744e5ac591bf06c83657d297a932/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761075751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518040/52a8641